            "text": "Anathema",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " censor or destroy legitimate works of art, leave those who depend on you to fend for themselves at the last minute, use phrases like \"good luck\" that might tempt the fickle forces of fate to ensure the opposite comes to pass"
          }
        ]
